('M254306','Publication Designer','254306','Publication Designer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'creating world class, user centered designs through considerations of user research, business requirements, customer feedback and usability study findings. developing conceptual diagrams, wireframes, visual mockups, prototypes and visual design of web and mobile applications. developing and maintaining detailed user interface specifications. presenting design works to user experience, product, business owners for review and feedback. creating and implementing usability studies, personality, navigational structures, and affinity diagrams. providing usability recommendations based on industry best practices, analytics, and user behavior. collaborating proactively with the other members of the team including from different expertise to solve problems. optimising user experience based on the compilation of data analytics of user activities. performing related tasks through digital content creation tools, visualization software, tools and technology; and. enhancing knowledge and coordinating work performance.','combine artistic and technical knowledge to conceptualize, plan, create, produce, develop digital content that display text, graphics, animation, imaging, audio and video, and other content type for various digital media including both linear and non-linear format.','medium','10','5','0','5',NULL,'Inherited from the MASCO four-digit unit-group task rating; child-specific human review remains pending.','medium','0.5',NULL,'Inherited from the D1 MASCO unit-group task pre-rating.',FALSE,'unit_group_inherited_pending_child_specific_two_rater_review','sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2','{0.0537949,0.0451258,-0.0449251,0.0012852,-0.0486837,-0.0478183,-0.0336766,0.0527846,0.0051712,0.0503085,-0.0973797,-0.0064036,0.0406585,0.0106771,0.0129981,-0.0116744,0.0509454,-0.0502768,0.0397555,0.0232006,0.0352905,-0.0165018,0.0144395,-0.0527171,-0.0297233,0.0003664,0.0701125,0.0040239,0.0664503,